<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <text class="eyebrow">课程目录</text>
    <text class="hero-title">选一门课开始学</text>
    <text class="hero-sub">60 门课按年龄段分组。也可以先在上方提交自己的教案，按同一套 10 步走。</text>
    <text class="hero-meta" wx:if="{{!loading}}">{{categoryCount}} 个类别 · {{catalogCount}} 门课{{refreshing ? ' · 正在同步' : ''}}</text>
  </view>
  <view class="upload-card">
    <view class="upload-head">
      <view class="hero-mark">
        <ui-icon name="upload" size="40" color="#4B6EF5"></ui-icon>
      </view>
      <view class="grow">
        <text class="eyebrow">PERSONAL PLAN</text>
        <text class="upload-title">上传个人教案</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <text class="upload-sub">上传你自己的教案，智能体会自动解析，并按照“十步交付法”引导你进行自学，产出你的专属讲课逐字稿。</text>
    <button class="btn" wx:if="{{!planOpen}}" bindtap="onOpenPlan">上传教案</button>
    <view wx:else>
      <view class="label">教案标题</view>
      <input class="field" placeholder="例如：破解分离焦虑" value="{{planTitle}}" bindinput="onPlanTitle" />
      <view class="label">教案正文（推荐粘贴）</view>
      <textarea
        class="area plan-area"
        placeholder="把教案全文粘贴在这里。Word / PDF 请先复制正文，不要只上传原文件。"
        value="{{planText}}"
        bindinput="onPlanText"
        maxlength="12000"
        auto-height
      ></textarea>
      <view class="muted">优先粘贴文本，最稳。txt / md 可以点下面从文件填入。</view>
      <view class="muted" wx:if="{{planFileName}}">已选 {{planFileName}}</view>
      <button class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="onPickPlan">从文件填入文本</button>
      <button class="btn" bindtap="onSubmitPlan" disabled="{{planSubmitting}}">开始十步自学</button>
      <view class="upload-cancel" bindtap="onClosePlan">先看下面的系统课</view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
  <view class="empty" wx:if="{{loading}}">
    <view class="empty-icon">
      <ui-icon name="book-open" size="48" color="#999999"></ui-icon>
    </view>
    正在读取课程目录…
  </view>
  <scroll-view scroll-x class="cats" wx:if="{{categories.length > 1}}">
    <view
      class="cat {{activeCategory === item.id ? 'on' : ''}}"
      wx:for="{{categories}}"
      wx:key="id"
      data-id="{{item.id}}"
      bindtap="onCategory"
    >{{item.name}}</view>
  </scroll-view>
  <view class="empty" wx:if="{{!loading && !sections.length}}">
    <view class="empty-icon">
      <ui-icon name="empty" size="48" color="#999999"></ui-icon>
    </view>
    课程目录暂时没有数据。请下拉刷新，或确认已登录。
  </view>
  <view class="group" wx:for="{{sections}}" wx:key="id" wx:for-item="section">
    <view class="group-head" style="border-left-color: {{section.accent}};">
      <view class="grow">
        <text class="name">{{section.name}}</text>
      </view>
      <text class="count">{{section.courses.length}} 门</text>
    </view>
    <view class="group-empty" wx:if="{{!section.courses.length}}">该分类暂无课程</view>
    <view
      class="lesson"
      hover-class="lesson-hover"
      hover-stay-time="80"
      wx:for="{{section.courses}}"
      wx:for-item="item"
      wx:key="lesson_code"
      data-code="{{item.lesson_code}}"
      data-title="{{item.title}}"
      bindtap="onOpen"
    >
      <text class="lesson-code">{{item.lesson_code}}</text>
      <view class="lesson-title">{{item.title}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
